# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shaded lightcones are calculated and used in 5 steps:\n"
msgstr "shaded lightcone은 5단계로 계산되고 사용됩니다.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compute a bound on the effect of each Pauli error term on the observable at the end of the circuit (forward bound)\n"
msgstr "회로 끝에서 각 Pauli 오류 항이 관측량에 미치는 영향의 경계를 계산합니다(순방향 경계)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compute a bound on the effect of each Pauli error term on the initial state at the beginning of the circuit (backward bound)\n"
msgstr "회로 시작 부분에서 각 Pauli 오류 항이 초기 상태에 미치는 영향의 경계를 계산합니다(역방향 경계)\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A three-qubit circuit with four unitary layers and a grid of error terms E1 to E12 between them. Error term E8 is highlighted. One arrow from E8 back to the initial state rho is labeled backward bound, and another arrow from E8 to the final observable A is labeled forward bound.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/bounds.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A three-qubit circuit with four unitary layers and a grid of error terms E1 to E12 between them. Error term E8 is highlighted. One arrow from E8 back to the initial state rho is labeled backward bound, and another arrow from E8 to the final observable A is labeled forward bound.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/bounds.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Approximate a bias contribution for each Pauli error term using the forward/backward bounds and the term’s error rate\n"
msgstr "순방향/역방향 경계와 해당 항의 오류율을 사용하여 각 Pauli 오류 항의 편향 기여도를 근사합니다\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Two 3-by-4 grids of numbered error terms, one shaded by backward bound and one by forward bound. Arrows from both point to a third grid labeled partition and merge, which combines the two sets of bounds and highlights term 8.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/merge_bounds.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Two 3-by-4 grids of numbered error terms, one shaded by backward bound and one by forward bound. Arrows from both point to a third grid labeled partition and merge, which combines the two sets of bounds and highlights term 8.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/merge_bounds.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '4.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prioritize error terms based on their error rate and bounds. Truncate terms from the noise model which have the least effect on the observable expectation value until the user-specified bias tolerance is hit. Alternatively, one can add the most impactful error terms to a noise model until the user-specified sampling cost budget is filled.\n"
msgstr "오류율과 경계에 따라 오류 항의 우선순위를 정합니다. 사용자가 지정한 편향 허용치에 도달할 때까지, 관측량 기댓값에 미치는 영향이 가장 작은 항을 노이즈 모델에서 잘라냅니다. 또는 사용자가 지정한 샘플링 비용 예산이 찰 때까지 가장 영향이 큰 오류 항을 노이즈 모델에 추가할 수도 있습니다.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A row of numbered error terms sorted from most to least impactful, starting with term 8 and ending with terms 1, 2, 10 and 12. The last five terms, shaded darkest, are separated from the rest and labeled truncate.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/prioritize_and_truncate.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A row of numbered error terms sorted from most to least impactful, starting with term 8 and ending with terms 1, 2, 10 and 12. The last five terms, shaded darkest, are separated from the rest and labeled truncate.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/prioritize_and_truncate.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '5.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mitigate the truncated noise model. Using the [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model) from Qiskit Runtime, specifying error terms to ignore during PEC sampling is straightforward. See the [tutorial](/tutorials/pec-with-shaded-lightcones) for details.\n"
msgstr "잘라낸 노이즈 모델을 완화합니다. Qiskit Runtime의 [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model)을 사용하면 PEC 샘플링 중 무시할 오류 항을 간단히 지정할 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 [튜토리얼](/tutorials/pec-with-shaded-lightcones)을 참조하세요.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![The prioritized list of retained error terms, 8, 11, 7, 5, 6, 3 and 4, with an arrow pointing to a three-qubit circuit. Each retained term appears in the circuit as an inverse noise gate, labeled lambda inverse, between the unitary layers.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/reduced_pec.avif)\n"
msgstr "![The prioritized list of retained error terms, 8, 11, 7, 5, 6, 3 and 4, with an arrow pointing to a three-qubit circuit. Each retained term appears in the circuit as an inverse noise gate, labeled lambda inverse, between the unitary layers.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-addon-slc/reduced_pec.avif)\n"

